    {
      "id": "introductions",
      "title": "Literature · Compact Introductions",
      "role": "main",
      "summary": "Standalone introductions and narrative readings, with endings discussed. Some link to longer existing studies in other packs; the ancient additions are substantive self-contained readings rather than aliases to an unfinished deep dive.",
